# Rust Rules
- Edition 2021
- Result<T, String> for Tauri IPC commands
- Derive Clone, Debug on public structs
- serde Serialize/Deserialize on IPC types
- rayon::par_iter for parallel sweeps
- Avoid unwrap(), use ? operator
- Pine modules in src/pine/ submodule
